---
source: crates/onequery-cli/src/cli/../cli_tests.rs
expression: "rendered_display(&[\"onequery\"])"
---
OneQuery CLI

Usage: onequery [OPTIONS] [COMMAND]

Commands:
  auth     Manage authentication and stored sessions
  backup   Create a self-host backup archive from the current runtime state
  config   Persist local CLI targeting defaults
  org      Inspect org access and select the active org
  source   Inspect sources available to the active org
  query    Execute or validate source queries
  restore  Restore a self-host backup archive into the runtime directories
  gateway  Bootstrap or inspect the self-host gateway lifecycle surface
  use      Load provider-specific skill content for non-SQL sources
  help     Print this message or the help of the given subcommand(s)

Options:
  -h, --help
          Print help

  -V, --version
          Print version

Global Options:
      --org <ORG_SLUG>
          Override the active org for this invocation

  -c, --config <KEY=VALUE>
          Apply a raw config override for this invocation using `key=value`

      --request-id <REQUEST_ID>
          Attach a caller-supplied request ID to outbound API requests

      --timeout <SECONDS>
          Override the request timeout in seconds for this invocation

      --output <OUTPUT>
          Choose text or JSON output
          
          [possible values: text, json]

      --verbose
          Emit workflow progress and retry tracing to stderr
